  "details": "So this has been happening for a while now where someone (presumably the world creator) will use bot accounts to join many different groups and then open group+ instances of their world in each group. The bot will then idle in the world to keep the instance constantly open and artificially boost the popularity of the world.\n\nThere was at least 10 different instances of this at one point with one of them still remaining over a week later as of right now. This has also happened with another world from the same creator. With no way to block/hide a world, it just clutters the groups tab in the social menu.",
